(2154209, 295065, 42005, '<td valign="top">Somehow the innocence of a child eating cake which an adult has obviously given her seems to be a stretch to the sin of Gluttony.  Perhaps it should have been the sin of pride (not in an accusatory sense, please!) or even envy (that one can not eat what a child does and stay thin....(that too is a stretch).  Just one opinion and please do not take it personally, only as my personal reaction.  I am so hesitant about writing my<br/>gut reaction here on DP.</td>', 'Somehow the innocence of a child eating cake which an adult has obviously given her seems to be a stretch to the sin of Gluttony.  Perhaps it should have been the sin of pride (not in an accusatory sense, please!) or even envy (that one can not eat what a child does and stay thin....(that too is a stretch).  Just one opinion and please do not take it personally, only as my personal reaction.  I am so hesitant about writing mygut reaction here on DP.', '2006-02-15 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
