(2156130, 295872, 19982, '<td valign="top">Feels like either too much Neat Image (how could a young girl''s soft/smooth skin need NI anyway?) or maybe the camera wasn''t in focus.  Her eyes look like they may have been sharp, so maybe it''s just very shallow DOF.  But her nose, mouth, chin, cheeks all feel "strangly blurred" and the mole actually looks like motion blur which I don''t understand because it looks like you had a lot of light.<br/> <br/>Anyway, my point is... if this is the result of post processing, then I''m willing to bet that the original is much more compelling than this.  Young kids don''t need much post processing to look beautiful.  :-)</td>', 'Feels like either too much Neat Image (how could a young girl''s soft/smooth skin need NI anyway?) or maybe the camera wasn''t in focus.  Her eyes look like they may have been sharp, so maybe it''s just very shallow DOF.  But her nose, mouth, chin, cheeks all feel "strangly blurred" and the mole actually looks like motion blur which I don''t understand because it looks like you had a lot of light. Anyway, my point is... if this is the result of post processing, then I''m willing to bet that the original is much more compelling than this.  Young kids don''t need much post processing to look beautiful.  :-)', '2006-02-16 07:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
