(2159436, 295552, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is my favourite and only 10 so far. Lighting is superb and the pose, the colours (black and red - colours of passion) are expressing the sinful lust, there is also pride on her face. A top quality photo and my pick for the blue!</td>', 'Wow! This is my favourite and only 10 so far. Lighting is superb and the pose, the colours (black and red - colours of passion) are expressing the sinful lust, there is also pride on her face. A top quality photo and my pick for the blue!', '2006-02-17 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
