(2159442, 295065, 3087, '<td valign="top">A charming portrait with wonderful natural expression and nice composition and backdrop too but let down by focus for me. This is an image that, in my opinion, really needs a higher depth of field to give sharp focus on her hands, mouth and eyes.</td>', 'A charming portrait with wonderful natural expression and nice composition and backdrop too but let down by focus for me. This is an image that, in my opinion, really needs a higher depth of field to give sharp focus on her hands, mouth and eyes.', '2006-02-17 16:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159445, 293437, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, nice one1 Finding the lighting a touch too harsh for my preferences though I appreciate it helps achieve a clean white background. The blowout on the body is a shame. Nice pose, nice composition and nice use of props!</td>', 'Ha ha, nice one1 Finding the lighting a touch too harsh for my preferences though I appreciate it helps achieve a clean white background. The blowout on the body is a shame. Nice pose, nice composition and nice use of props!', '2006-02-17 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159446, 293453, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL did you put one confused snail ontop of the other? Nice detail and nice clean background but I''m not sure Mr Top Guy is going to get anywhere through Mr Bottom Guy''s shell! :o)</td>', 'ROFL did you put one confused snail ontop of the other? Nice detail and nice clean background but I''m not sure Mr Top Guy is going to get anywhere through Mr Bottom Guy''s shell! :o)', '2006-02-17 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159454, 295636, 10858, '<td valign="top">Overexposed, out of focus, unrealizeable, low quality, provocative, disctracting backgound, not sinful... 7 deadly reasons for a brown ribbon. Hey, I am sure you can do better than this!</td>', 'Overexposed, out of focus, unrealizeable, low quality, provocative, disctracting backgound, not sinful... 7 deadly reasons for a brown ribbon. Hey, I am sure you can do better than this!', '2006-02-17 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159465, 295839, 3087, '<td valign="top">Controversial! I won''t get political about it but I will say kudos for the courage in presenting an image that''s going to garner a LOT of angry reaction. Very grainy, I''m assuming that''s intentional? In terms of composition I really like the sweep of the barbed wire but find the positioning of the bullets a bit too centred.</td>', 'Controversial! I won''t get political about it but I will say kudos for the courage in presenting an image that''s going to garner a LOT of angry reaction. Very grainy, I''m assuming that''s intentional? In terms of composition I really like the sweep of the barbed wire but find the positioning of the bullets a bit too centred.', '2006-02-17 16:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
