(2159477, 293586, 3087, '<td valign="top">This must have been so much fun to do! It has certainly made me smile! I think it''s one of those images that works well on first viewing because of the entertainment value but I can''t imagine it being one I''d come back to again and again. Fun though!</td>', 'This must have been so much fun to do! It has certainly made me smile! I think it''s one of those images that works well on first viewing because of the entertainment value but I can''t imagine it being one I''d come back to again and again. Fun though!', '2006-02-17 16:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
