(2159481, 295767, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love shallow DOF. This is quite clever - the more compelling subject is the woman but the one in focus is the apple that tempts her. I like how that makes the woman an anonymous "everywoman" figure. Lighting seems a bit harsh leading to loss of detail around edges of fingers but otherwise strong.</td>', 'Love shallow DOF. This is quite clever - the more compelling subject is the woman but the one in focus is the apple that tempts her. I like how that makes the woman an anonymous "everywoman" figure. Lighting seems a bit harsh leading to loss of detail around edges of fingers but otherwise strong.', '2006-02-17 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
