(2160536, 295289, 10858, '<td valign="top">The expressions on the faces are loveable!!! Indeeed a great idea and composition, the colours are a good choice, the red for the mum works well with the reds of the chocolate boxes. I mention 2 issues which should be changed to make this one a top shot. The smaller one is that table cloth is overexposed, but the background''s wraps are more ditracting. You did set up an amazing shot, please, take care about ironing the background as well. I was hesitating between 5 and 6, but finally I decided 6.</td>', 'The expressions on the faces are loveable!!! Indeeed a great idea and composition, the colours are a good choice, the red for the mum works well with the reds of the chocolate boxes. I mention 2 issues which should be changed to make this one a top shot. The smaller one is that table cloth is overexposed, but the background''s wraps are more ditracting. You did set up an amazing shot, please, take care about ironing the background as well. I was hesitating between 5 and 6, but finally I decided 6.', '2006-02-18 02:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
