(2161267, 293416, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congratulation!   That is truly stunning.  Can''t wait until after the challenge to see how you did this.   I hope you explained.  I''ll have to pm you if I see N/A in the description :)   10</td>', 'Wow! Congratulation!   That is truly stunning.  Can''t wait until after the challenge to see how you did this.   I hope you explained.  I''ll have to pm you if I see N/A in the description :)   10', '2006-02-18 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
