(2163349, 295082, 52731, '<td valign="top">Simple and well done. I really like this.</td>', 'Simple and well done. I really like this.', '2006-02-19 13:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163350, 294430, 52731, '<td valign="top">This turned out really well.</td>', 'This turned out really well.', '2006-02-19 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163351, 294025, 52731, '<td valign="top">Is that Conan?</td>', 'Is that Conan?', '2006-02-19 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163355, 295451, 52731, '<td valign="top">Really well done.</td>', 'Really well done.', '2006-02-19 13:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163357, 295217, 52731, '<td valign="top">I like the hello kitty clock, nice touch.</td>', 'I like the hello kitty clock, nice touch.', '2006-02-19 13:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163481, 295536, 33061, '<td valign="top">Quite a funny picture, but the kid''s one eye being crossed is really a distraction for me, and while I understand it''s mostly likely the focus of the picture, it is distracting in a negative way.</td>', 'Quite a funny picture, but the kid''s one eye being crossed is really a distraction for me, and while I understand it''s mostly likely the focus of the picture, it is distracting in a negative way.', '2006-02-19 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163483, 294587, 33061, '<td valign="top">Quite the furball... :)</td>', 'Quite the furball... :)', '2006-02-19 15:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163491, 295105, 33061, '<td valign="top">Good take on the "7 Deadly Sins" theme. It seems that the contrast is a bit overdone, and the DOF is too shallow (the tip of the needle being out of focus for instance)</td>', 'Good take on the "7 Deadly Sins" theme. It seems that the contrast is a bit overdone, and the DOF is too shallow (the tip of the needle being out of focus for instance)', '2006-02-19 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163493, 293015, 33061, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo, nice light and composition. Well done :)</td>', 'Sharp photo, nice light and composition. Well done :)', '2006-02-19 15:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163501, 295134, 33061, '<td valign="top">The shadows along her stomach are interesting, but the shadow created by her breast and nipple are distracting. I can''t offer a suggestion on how to re-shoot it with different lighting, as I think you''d lose the shadows along her torso, which I think make this an interesting shot</td>', 'The shadows along her stomach are interesting, but the shadow created by her breast and nipple are distracting. I can''t offer a suggestion on how to re-shoot it with different lighting, as I think you''d lose the shadows along her torso, which I think make this an interesting shot', '2006-02-19 15:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163519, 295349, 49858, '<td valign="top">Lacks focus, which isn''t helped by setting the jpeg compression too high.</td>', 'Lacks focus, which isn''t helped by setting the jpeg compression too high.', '2006-02-19 15:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163527, 295679, 33061, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes the smoke make...I see everything from human bones to a nuclear explosion. I''m hard pressed to see how this is fits into one of the seven deadly sins, however. It could be just me, I can be a bit obtuse when it comes to analyizing photos and other like mediums.<br/> <br/>Also, I think this would''ve had a lot more impact with a solid, neutral background, such as white.</td>', 'I like the shapes the smoke make...I see everything from human bones to a nuclear explosion. I''m hard pressed to see how this is fits into one of the seven deadly sins, however. It could be just me, I can be a bit obtuse when it comes to analyizing photos and other like mediums. Also, I think this would''ve had a lot more impact with a solid, neutral background, such as white.', '2006-02-19 15:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163528, 295531, 33061, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I think the softness is a bit overdone, especially on the man''s eyebrow area...that, combined with the lighting gives him a hollow-eyed look, with the eyebrow being hard to distinguish.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I think the softness is a bit overdone, especially on the man''s eyebrow area...that, combined with the lighting gives him a hollow-eyed look, with the eyebrow being hard to distinguish.', '2006-02-19 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163530, 293849, 33061, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, and nice, sharp picture. Nice work</td>', 'Beautiful sky, and nice, sharp picture. Nice work', '2006-02-19 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163533, 295767, 33061, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF used...really brings out the apple, without that being the sole occupant of the picture.</td>', 'I like the DOF used...really brings out the apple, without that being the sole occupant of the picture.', '2006-02-19 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163534, 293586, 33061, '<td valign="top">This, out of all the pictures so far, at least made me chuckle. What a nightmare of a wedding day that would be :)</td>', 'This, out of all the pictures so far, at least made me chuckle. What a nightmare of a wedding day that would be :)', '2006-02-19 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163540, 295798, 33061, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot...but I think this composition would''ve been better served by putting the Canon in front of a mirror and setting the timer to have it snap a picture of itself, with a smaller aperture setting to get more of the camera in focus.</td>', 'An interesting shot...but I think this composition would''ve been better served by putting the Canon in front of a mirror and setting the timer to have it snap a picture of itself, with a smaller aperture setting to get more of the camera in focus.', '2006-02-19 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163542, 295373, 33061, '<td valign="top">The pennies against the hardwood floor work really well for me...the hands blurred, not so much...</td>', 'The pennies against the hardwood floor work really well for me...the hands blurred, not so much...', '2006-02-19 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163545, 295771, 33061, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture. About the only thing I can offer is nitpicky at best: I think the background should be one solid color (it appears to be some sort of cloth...muslim?) and the nickle in the back, just to the right of the dollar bill on the right needs some polishing (told you they were nitpicky ;)</td>', 'Nice Picture. About the only thing I can offer is nitpicky at best: I think the background should be one solid color (it appears to be some sort of cloth...muslim?) and the nickle in the back, just to the right of the dollar bill on the right needs some polishing (told you they were nitpicky ;)', '2006-02-19 15:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163553, 293437, 33061, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good exposure, and I like the composition...but, quite frankly, the mouse ruins it for me...</td>', 'Nice picture, good exposure, and I like the composition...but, quite frankly, the mouse ruins it for me...', '2006-02-19 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
