(2167344, 295535, 44611, '<td valign="top">There''s a snapshot quality to this even though the composition is good.  Cropped too tight both top and bottom I think - we need to see the little boat the guy is on to truly understand the envy emotion towards the bigger boat.</td>', 'There''s a snapshot quality to this even though the composition is good.  Cropped too tight both top and bottom I think - we need to see the little boat the guy is on to truly understand the envy emotion towards the bigger boat.', '2006-02-21 06:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
