(2169713, 293416, 19952, '<td valign="top">If anyone has ever told you not to play with fire, they were wrong. :-) This is one of the more interesting and better exposed fire shots I''ve seen here. And it''s much safer than lighting your thumb on fire!</td>', 'If anyone has ever told you not to play with fire, they were wrong. :-) This is one of the more interesting and better exposed fire shots I''ve seen here. And it''s much safer than lighting your thumb on fire!', '2006-02-22 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 0),
