(2169778, 293416, 8891, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on your first ribbon, Andi! Excellent capture.</td>', 'Big congrats on your first ribbon, Andi! Excellent capture.', '2006-02-22 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2169797, 293849, 48245, '<td valign="top">Thank you. <br/> <br/>The sky was all levels. <br/> <br/>As I commented, it was a grey, misty, cold day in San Antonio. When I took the picture the birds came out as silhouttes. I wasn''t taking the picture for the challenge but was trying to take pictures of the vultures per the wildlife challenge. But the dang birds wouldn''t let me get close enough ;-).<br/> <br/>When I was playing around with the pictures on my computer, the symbolism occurred to me with this challenge and I remembered this particular Bible verse so I started playing around with the images to see if I could get something I liked. That is when I discovered how setting the color tempurature on a raw image can affect the color!<br/> <br/>I kept tweaking it till I could get to the red sky... I like the picture and I don''t take any offense to the 51 low votes.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you.  The sky was all levels.  As I commented, it was a grey, misty, cold day in San Antonio. When I took the picture the birds came out as silhouttes. I wasn''t taking the picture for the challenge but was trying to take pictures of the vultures per the wildlife challenge. But the dang birds wouldn''t let me get close enough ;-). When I was playing around with the pictures on my computer, the symbolism occurred to me with this challenge and I remembered this particular Bible verse so I started playing around with the images to see if I could get something I liked. That is when I discovered how setting the color tempurature on a raw image can affect the color! I kept tweaking it till I could get to the red sky... I like the picture and I don''t take any offense to the 51 low votes. ', '2006-02-22 01:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2169881, 293437, 37893, '<td valign="top">yay Judi! One of my top 10 scores ;) Love this image. Great high key ;) Congrats on yet another ribbon.</td>', 'yay Judi! One of my top 10 scores ;) Love this image. Great high key ;) Congrats on yet another ribbon.', '2006-02-22 01:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2169901, 293453, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humour, quality in this well deserved blue ribbon shot. Congrats Phillip!!</td>', 'Great sense of humour, quality in this well deserved blue ribbon shot. Congrats Phillip!!', '2006-02-22 01:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
