(2170914, 295850, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I think I finally figured out what this one is!  2 fingers held up to the side of your cheek... thats your hair and your chin!  And you tried to give it a golden tone to represent things turning to gold with the Midas Touch!  Or, I could be wrong :)</td>', 'Ok.. I think I finally figured out what this one is!  2 fingers held up to the side of your cheek... thats your hair and your chin!  And you tried to give it a golden tone to represent things turning to gold with the Midas Touch!  Or, I could be wrong :)', '2006-02-22 09:50:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2171032, 295134, 28710, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done. I would have liked the distracting shadows on the bottom cropped off, but that''s just me.<br/> <br/>Also, I don''t think that Solomon''s poetry was so much of a sin. He was living at a time when polygamy was permitted, but the Kings of Israel were instructed not to go multiplying wives for themselves. One can assume that this would have meant more about the numbers rather than the act of pursuit.<br/> <br/>Super nice pic though. You''re a lucky man.</td>', 'Really nicely done. I would have liked the distracting shadows on the bottom cropped off, but that''s just me. Also, I don''t think that Solomon''s poetry was so much of a sin. He was living at a time when polygamy was permitted, but the Kings of Israel were instructed not to go multiplying wives for themselves. One can assume that this would have meant more about the numbers rather than the act of pursuit. Super nice pic though. You''re a lucky man.', '2006-02-22 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2171270, 295839, 10342, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, when you posted this to a challenge about the deadly sin of pride, you are saying that our nation''s miltary is prideful to the level of being sinful... and for that inference I have to doubt your disclaimer about truly loving our country. Your arrogance and utter ungratefulness for the lives of our military mean and women, past and present that have paid for our freedoms with their lives and their wounded bodies is astounding, to the point of being sickening.</td>', 'In my opinion, when you posted this to a challenge about the deadly sin of pride, you are saying that our nation''s miltary is prideful to the level of being sinful... and for that inference I have to doubt your disclaimer about truly loving our country. Your arrogance and utter ungratefulness for the lives of our military mean and women, past and present that have paid for our freedoms with their lives and their wounded bodies is astounding, to the point of being sickening.', '2006-02-22 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
