(2172020, 293416, 16912, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments folks :) and yikes! a yellow :)<br/> <br/>For those that asked, yes, its a single shot and probably the least editing I''ve ever done to a pic (oh, and my trademark bad border!). The setup is £101 in change (yes, I counted it) and I just poured meths into the bowl and set light to it capturing 2 to 3 shots per ''light''. I have some pretty good flames but this one literaly jumped out.<br/> <br/>When I was clearing up there was still meths in the bowl that I couldnt burn so (stupidly) I poured the coins onto another table and set light to them again and, after a scary moment I managed to quell the flames but sadly the table is no more!</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments folks :) and yikes! a yellow :) For those that asked, yes, its a single shot and probably the least editing I''ve ever done to a pic (oh, and my trademark bad border!). The setup is £101 in change (yes, I counted it) and I just poured meths into the bowl and set light to it capturing 2 to 3 shots per ''light''. I have some pretty good flames but this one literaly jumped out. When I was clearing up there was still meths in the bowl that I couldnt burn so (stupidly) I poured the coins onto another table and set light to them again and, after a scary moment I managed to quell the flames but sadly the table is no more!', '2006-02-22 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
