(2174577, 293453, 5885, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love it... Congrats on the BLUE!</td>', 'I absolutely love it... Congrats on the BLUE!', '2006-02-23 00:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2174613, 295902, 14653, '<td valign="top">Since I don''t know how to update the "Photographer''s Comments" above, I will just write here I guess....<br/> <br/>First, thanks to everyone for commenting and voting. I sincerely appreciate it.<br/> <br/>Some were skeptical of the image, but this is not a composite. I used my 18-70 with 4x, 2x, and 1x close-up filters. Since my brother couldn''t seem to sit still very long, I had to go with a larger aperture, which of course led to the more shallow dof. I would have prefered deeper depth of field, but it just wouldnt work. I tried a remote sb600 as fill, but then I kept washing out the reflection, so no flash...<br/> <br/>The reflection is actually an image on the monitor of my laptop, which I positioned over him while he lay on the floor. <br/> <br/>Thanks again. I really appreciate it...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-23 00:24:25.</i></td>', 'Since I don''t know how to update the "Photographer''s Comments" above, I will just write here I guess.... First, thanks to everyone for commenting and voting. I sincerely appreciate it. Some were skeptical of the image, but this is not a composite. I used my 18-70 with 4x, 2x, and 1x close-up filters. Since my brother couldn''t seem to sit still very long, I had to go with a larger aperture, which of course led to the more shallow dof. I would have prefered deeper depth of field, but it just wouldnt work. I tried a remote sb600 as fill, but then I kept washing out the reflection, so no flash... The reflection is actually an image on the monitor of my laptop, which I positioned over him while he lay on the floor.  Thanks again. I really appreciate it...', '2006-02-23 00:19:21.000000', '2006-02-23 00:24:25.000000', 0),
(2174664, 293453, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a beauty of a shot.  Such great detail and great aesthetics.  <br/> <br/>Congratulations on your first ribbon, and in that pretty color blue too!</td>', 'Wow, this is a beauty of a shot.  Such great detail and great aesthetics.   Congratulations on your first ribbon, and in that pretty color blue too!', '2006-02-23 00:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2174848, 295294, 45579, '<td valign="top">good pic.</td>', 'good pic.', '2006-02-23 02:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2175247, 295722, 48471, '<td valign="top">I love this image, it''s so clear and clean, simple and beautiful. The model is beautiful and has such an expressive look. I also like the hair blowing.<br/>The only trouble I had while voting is that it doesn''t really talk sin. But, after the sin challenge has finished, I''ll come to this photo time after time, not to look for the sin, but to enjoy and celebrate life and it''s naughty bits.</td>', 'I love this image, it''s so clear and clean, simple and beautiful. The model is beautiful and has such an expressive look. I also like the hair blowing.The only trouble I had while voting is that it doesn''t really talk sin. But, after the sin challenge has finished, I''ll come to this photo time after time, not to look for the sin, but to enjoy and celebrate life and it''s naughty bits.', '2006-02-23 07:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2175253, 293877, 48471, '<td valign="top">I guess Freud would have hung this in his office.<br/>A great photo that I''d like to work on. So many variations of it come to mind (model with the tongue out, eyebrow streched...), that it tells me this is a piece of art.</td>', 'I guess Freud would have hung this in his office.A great photo that I''d like to work on. So many variations of it come to mind (model with the tongue out, eyebrow streched...), that it tells me this is a piece of art.', '2006-02-23 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
