(4713516, 294398, 27373, '<td valign="top">This has always been one of my favorite shots from the challenge.  The slight <i>oof</i> of the woman on the couch and the crisp sharpness of the strappy shoe combine to tell a much greater story than if everything was sharply focused.  There is also an interesting contrast between the woman on the couch in what looks like a simple pink t-shirt and the fishnet stockings and "sexual themed" shoe of the other woman (I assume its another woman, or the woman on the couch is an amazing contortionist).</td>', 'This has always been one of my favorite shots from the challenge.  The slight oof of the woman on the couch and the crisp sharpness of the strappy shoe combine to tell a much greater story than if everything was sharply focused.  There is also an interesting contrast between the woman on the couch in what looks like a simple pink t-shirt and the fishnet stockings and "sexual themed" shoe of the other woman (I assume its another woman, or the woman on the couch is an amazing contortionist).', '2008-05-20 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
